<title>USA: Coalinga-Huron JUSD, Calif., won by Dean Witter. [CORRECTED 30/5 00:02 GMT]</title>
<headline>Coalinga-Huron JUSD, Calif., won by Dean Witter. [CORRECTED 30/5 00:02 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>(Corrects to show that Dean Witter and not Smith Barney won the deal. Smith Barney's bid was late and therefore rejected.)</p>
<p>Dean Witter said Thursday it won $4.2 million Coalinga-Huron USD, Calif., general obligation bonds, Election of 1997, Series A, with a true interest cost of 5.4870 percent.</p>
